erk limits of grades A, B and C with two decimals ("" when none — a claim of its person's grade on the sheet's today uses the one in force then in place of the sheet's), and its default grade (A, B or C; "" when blank, meaning A; not dated — a person added by the quick-add bar, or by an import line with a blank grade, gets it). Each of those is the value in force on the
